# User guide screenshots (scripts/docs_shots.sh; their rows in tests/ui/docs/images.tsv):
# the Audiobooks list, a book on Now Playing, and the book's page (Resume
# first, then its chapters). Runs on the release-shaped sim with the video
# player, so the menus are the ones a release shows; in tests/ui/docs/, so
# the gate's tests/ui/*.script sweep leaves it alone. Synthetic library only
# (tests/ui/setup_library.py): no owner media.
# Deterministic: "# fresh-db" drops the database's play statistics and
# "# reset: books" the per-book resume store (artcache/books.dat), which
# is what puts the last book played at the top of Audiobooks and outlives a
# fresh database; with both, every run opens the same list.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-rel-video scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/docs/docs-audiobooks.script
# needs: library
# needs: video
# fresh-db
# reset: books
# golden: skip
# timeout: 180
wait 4000
wait_db 45000
art_wait 60000
sim_clock 9:41
clock_format 12
battery 100
wait 1000
key SELECT          # Music
wait 800
wheel +6 300        # Audiobooks
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1000
shot list           # no book played yet: nothing pinned on top
wheel +3 300        # Winter Stories (a title short enough not to scroll)
wait 400
key SELECT          # the book's page: its chapters (no Resume yet)
wait 1500
shot chapters_first
key SELECT          # the first chapter: starts the book, opens Now Playing
wait_pos 1500 20000
np_pin 2000 50
wait 2500           # the slide into Now Playing has settled
shot now_playing
key PLAY            # pause: the resume position is saved
wait 500
key MENU            # back to the book's page
wait 800
key MENU            # back to Audiobooks
wait 1000
key SELECT          # the book's page again: Resume first
wait 1200
shot chapters
quit
